    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Woooow, I thought this place would be bigger
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Quiet! This is the house of God! ...Although there were some time constraints,
        builders went missing, et cetera
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: It exists, I guess. That counts for something, kind of
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Anyway, be careful! I think I heard something move...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
